---
import BaseLayout from "~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "~/styles/legal.css";
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Cookies Policy"
    description="Last updated: 2024-10-25"
    locale="en"
>
    <div class="legal-container">
        <h1>Cookies Policy</h1>

        <p>
            To ensure the reliability, security, and personalization of this
            website and software I develop, I use cookies. When you accept
            cookies, they help improve the website by identifying your identity,
            remembering your preferences, and providing a personalized user
            experience.
        </p>

        <p>
            This policy should be read alongside my <a href="/en/privacy-policy"
                >Privacy Policy</a
            >, which explains how I use personal information.
        </p>

        <p>
            If you have any questions about how I use your personal information
            or cookies, please contact me at qlad_adgk@163.com.
        </p>

        <h2>What Are Cookies?</h2>

        <p>
            Cookies are small text files that websites may place on your
            computer or device when you visit. Cookies help websites recognize
            your device when you visit again. Website beacons, pixels, or
            similar files can do the same thing. I use the term "cookies" in
            this policy to refer to all files that collect information this way.
        </p>

        <h2>Purposes of Cookies</h2>

        <p>I categorize cookies into the following purposes:</p>

        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr><th>Purpose</th><th>Description</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>Authorization</td>
                    <td
                        >When you visit my website, cookies provide the correct
                        information to create a personalized experience for you.</td
                    >
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Security</td>
                    <td
                        >I use cookies to enable and support security features,
                        monitor and prevent suspicious activities, fraudulent
                        traffic, and copyright violations.</td
                    >
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Preferences & Services</td>
                    <td
                        >I use functional cookies to remember your preferences
                        or save information you provide about your likes or
                        other details.</td
                    >
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Personalized Advertising</td>
                    <td
                        >This site does not involve personalized advertising
                        services.</td
                    >
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Performance & Analytics</td>
                    <td
                        >I use these cookies to monitor website performance,
                        allowing me to provide a high-quality experience by
                        quickly identifying and resolving issues.</td
                    >
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <h2>Third-Party Cookies</h2>

        <p>
            I also use third-party cookies on my website for the following
            purposes:
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>Help monitor traffic on the website;</li>
            <li>Identify fraudulent or non-human traffic;</li>
            <li>Assist with market research;</li>
            <li>Improve website functionality;</li>
            <li>Monitor compliance with copyright and privacy policies.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How to Manage Cookies?</h2>

        <p>
            Before placing cookies on your computer or device, a popup will be
            displayed asking you to consent to these cookies. By consenting to
            place cookies, you allow me to provide you with the best experience
            and services. If you wish, you can refuse to consent by disabling
            cookies in your browser settings; however, some features of my
            website may not work fully or as expected.
        </p>

        <p>
            For more information on how to control cookies in all major
            browsers:
        </p>

        <p>
            <a
                href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647?hl=en"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener">Google Chrome</a
            ><br />
            <a
                href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/help/260971/description-of-cookies"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener">Internet Explorer</a
            ><br />
            <a
                href="https://support.apple.com/guide/safari/manage-cookies-and-website-data-sfri11471/mac"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener">Safari (Desktop)</a
            ><br />
            <a
                href="https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/cookies-information-websites-store-on-your-computer"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener">Firefox</a
            >
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>

        <p>
            For more information about my data processing, please see my <a
                href="/en/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a
            >. If you have any questions about this cookie policy, please
            contact qlad_adgk@163.com.
        </p>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>

